{% comment %}
  Predictive search input — rendered from the <search-drawer> template inside
  sections/main-nav.liquid (2026-10-10 刘工: the header row shows an icon only;
  the full form lives in the right-side drawer).

  Split from sections/predictive-search.liquid on purpose: a section cannot be
  rendered into another file, but a snippet can. main-nav owns the drawer, so
  the input lives here, while the RESULTS markup lives in the section — that
  file must stand alone because Shopify re-renders it by section_id
  (`section_id=predictive-search` targets the section FILE name).

  Parameters:
    search_section_id — used for input/panel id pairing (unique per section).
    results_limit     — forwarded as data-results-limit for the JS fetch.

  ARIA: the input keeps its combobox + listbox pattern INSIDE the drawer. The
  drawer itself is a modal <dialog>, but the combobox behaviour is unchanged:
  DOM focus stays in the input; arrow keys move a virtual cursor via
  aria-activedescendant. Escape is left to bubble when the results panel is
  closed, so it closes the drawer (layered dismiss: panel → drawer).

  Progressive enhancement baseline: action points at the real search URL, so with JS
  disabled the form still searches. The script only enhances it.
{% endcomment %}

  <predictive-search
    class="predictive-search"
    data-results-limit="{{ results_limit | default: 10 }}"
  >
    <form
      class="predictive-search__form"
      action="{{ routes.search_url }}"
      method="get"
      role="search"
    >
    <label class="visually-hidden" for="search-input-{{ search_section_id }}">
      {{ 'search.label' | t }}
    </label>

    {%- comment -%}
      输入区：放大镜（左）、输入框、清空按钮（右）与加载扫描线都锚定在
      这个相对定位的 field 上——form 自身改为纵向 flex 后，
      它的底边不再是"输入框下沿"，扫描线必须跟着 field 走。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="predictive-search__field">
      {%- comment -%}
        放大镜：纯视觉图标（aria-hidden + tabindex="-1"），可访问入口是输入框
        本身（combobox 语义）。
        清空按钮恢复（2026-10-10 刘工）：type=search 的原生 WebKit 清除 X
        无法定制样式，隐藏之，用与抽屉右上角关闭键同款的自定义按钮替代。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="predictive-search__submit"
        data-predictive-search-submit
        aria-hidden="true"
        tabindex="-1"
      >
        {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'search.submit' | t }}</span>
      </button>

      <input
        id="search-input-{{ search_section_id }}"
        class="predictive-search__input"
        type="search"
        name="q"
        value="{{ search.terms | escape }}"
        placeholder="{{ 'search.placeholder' | t | escape }}"
        autocomplete="off"
        autocorrect="off"
        autocapitalize="off"
        spellcheck="false"
        role="combobox"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="predictive-search-results-{{ search_section_id }}"
        aria-autocomplete="list"
        aria-describedby="predictive-search-help-{{ search_section_id }}"
      >

      {%- comment -%}
        清空输入：显隐由 JS 用 hidden 属性驱动（无输入时彻底离开无障碍树）。
        样式与抽屉右上角关闭键同款（2026-10-10 刘工）。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="predictive-search__clear"
        aria-label="{{ 'search.clear' | t }}"
        data-predictive-search-clear
        hidden
      >
        {{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
      </button>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="visually-hidden">
      {{ 'search.submit' | t }}
    </button>

    {%- comment -%}
      说明键盘操作方式。无结果时也保留——它解释的是控件行为，不是结果内容。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p id="predictive-search-help-{{ search_section_id }}" class="visually-hidden">
      {{ 'search.instructions' | t }}
    </p>

    {%- comment -%}
      结果容器由 JS 注入 HTML 片段。aria-controls 指向这个 id，
      JS 注入内容时复用同一个 id。不再是浮层：作为 flex 子项吃满
      dialog 剩余高度，滚动条只出现在列表上（2026-10-10 刘工）。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div
      class="predictive-search__panel"
      id="predictive-search-results-{{ search_section_id }}"
      hidden
    ></div>
  </form>

  {%- comment -%}
    骨架屏模板（2026-10-29 刘工："触发了搜索没有 loading 效果"）。
    JS（_queueSkeleton）在**面板本来为空**时延迟 120ms 克隆进上面的结果容器；
    已有上一轮结果时不动，避免边搜边闪。

    放 <template> 里而不是内联渲染：初始文档零节点、零请求，
    与抽屉"隐藏组件首次打开才建 DOM"同一取舍（AGENTS §6）。
    纯视觉占位——aria-hidden，加载语义由 <predictive-search> 的 aria-busy 承担。
    行尺寸（112px 缩略图 + 两行文字）刻意复刻真实结果行，换入结果时不跳。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <template data-predictive-search-skeleton>
    <div class="predictive-search__skeleton" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-heading"></div>
      {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
        <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-row">
          <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-thumb"></div>
          <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-text">
            <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-line"></div>
            <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-line predictive-search__skeleton-line--short"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </template>
</predictive-search>

{%- comment -%}
  2026-10-18：本片段原先自带一个样式块，当日已整体迁入 sections/main-nav.liquid
  的样式块（该 section 末尾，紧跟其原有样式之后）。
  原因：Shopify 的样式块标签只允许出现在 section/block 顶层，且一个文件只能有一个。
  本片段被 main-nav render 时，会与 section 自身的样式块形成"一个 section 两个样式块"，
  编辑器装载 header 组时整组渲染失败（画布页头空白，切一次显隐才出现）。
  改动记录见 .workbuddy/memory/2026-10-17.md 第三十三轮。
  注意：本注释里不要再写样式块标签的字面量，Liquid 注释块内出现未闭合的标签语法有解析风险。
{%- endcomment -%}

